            <note corresp="#d137-f1" n="1" xml:id="d137-f1-content">
                <p>See telegrams from the Chargé, June 19 and 27, <hi rendition="#italic">post</hi>,
                        <ref target="#pg103">pp. 103</ref> and <ref target="#pg110">110</ref>,
                    respectively.</p>
            </note>
